      "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2.overline 3+4.overline 3\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na.overline b = (ab - a)/9\n\n**Solution:**\n\n2.overline 3+4.overline 3\n\nAccording to the formula \n\n⇒ (23 - 2)/9 + (43 - 4)/9\n\n⇒ 21/9 + 39/9\n\n⇒ 60/9\n\n⇒ 20/3\n\n**∴ The value of 2.overline 3+4.overline 3 is 20/3.**",
