        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "64.2305"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "4",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: 15% of 1.5 + 0.15 ÷ 0.1 + 0.01 of 1.1 × 0.5 + 2.5 × 25\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n1. a% of b = a/100 × b\n\n2. Division and multiplication operations follow BODMAS/BIDMAS rules.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n15% of 1.5\n\n⇒ 15/100 × 15/10\n\n⇒ 0.225\n\n0.01 of 1.1 × 0.5 \n\n⇒ 1/100 × 11/10 × 5/10\n\n⇒ 0.0055\n\n2.5 × 25\n\n⇒ 25/10 × 25\n\n⇒ 62.5\n\nNow, summing all the parts together:\n\n0.225 + 1.5 + 0.0055 + 62.5\n\n⇒ 0.225 + 1.5 = 1.725\n\n⇒ 1.725 + 0.0055 = 1.7305\n\n⇒ 1.7305 + 62.5 = 64.2305\n\n**The correct answer is option 4.**",
      "tags": [
        "Decimals"
      ]
    },
